# DocSearch. Apply at https://docsearch.algolia.com/apply/ and copy the values
# from the Algolia dashboard. The key is the search-only one, which ships in the
# client bundle and is safe to expose; never use an admin or write key here.
# Leave these unset to build the site without a search box.
ALGOLIA_APP_ID=
ALGOLIA_SEARCH_API_KEY=
ALGOLIA_INDEX_NAME=
